  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Hung (Mechanic)
    Text: "I saw the Ranger earlier. She asked if I could \"mute\" your bike. I told
      her I\u2019m a mechanic, not a magician!"
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: She really has it out for us, doesn't she?
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Hung (Mechanic)
    Text: "She\u2019s just lonely up there. I think she actually likes the noise,
      it\u2019s the only sign of life she gets!"
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Ok sure, I'll let the engine sing on my way back then~
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Hung (Mechanic)
    Text: Haha! Go easy on her, man. My ears can only take so much complaining!
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
